[Music]  the upcoming john wick prequel series  the continental consists of three  episodes and was originally supposed to  be broadcast by the us channel stars  however according to media reports the  series will now be broadcast by the us  streaming service peacock instead  peacock president kelly campbell  expresses her joy about this deal for  example the three john wick movies which  are also exclusively available on  peacock are among the most watched films  in the streaming service the partnership  with lionsgate is an honor she says and  they will ensure that the continental  becomes one of the streaming highlights  of the coming year with the help of nbc  universal's full power the plot is set  in 1970s new york and revolves around  the young criminal winston scott also  well known from the movies winston  fights his way through the underworld  and wants to take over the hotel the  continental which serves as a meeting  place and hideout for numerous hitmen  and criminals in addition to colin  waddell as young winston scott we get to  see mel gibson as cormac peter green as  young uncle charlie ayo midae attagon as  charon and jeremy bob as mayhew among  others each of the three episodes will  be about 90 minutes long with the book  of eli director albert hughes handling  the production of episodes one and three  while the lord of the rings the rings of  power director charlotte branstrom will  take over the second episode the series  is scheduled for release next year at  which point we can also see the fourth  john wick movie in theaters on march  24th 2023  the hunger games the ballad of songbirds  and snakes has been in full production  for almost a year and now a first  picture is available it shows the two  main actors rachel zegler as lucy gray  and tom blythe is cory alanis snow while  gray is new to the franchise snow is  already known from the previous parts as  the dictatorial president of panam in  the upcoming prequel however he will be  seen in his younger years where he is  still working as a supervisor behind the  scenes of the hunger games director  francis lawrence who directed the  previous three movies recently spoke to  vanity fair about the new character gray  describing her as the anti-katniss  according to him she is musically gifted  charming a performer and does not have  much in common with the serious and  reserved main character of the original  film series as a result she arouses the  interest of the young corey elena snow  and they eventually fall in love for  snow who comes from humble beginnings  the games are extremely important lucy's  mentor sees the games as his big chance  to climb the social ladder and leave his  old life behind recent information also  concerns another new addition to the  feature film namely that viola davis is  to be added as the villain dr volumnia  gaul the character is the head game  maker of the 10th hunger games and is  said to be a very vicious figure she is  very energetic and has an almost  disturbing playful manner that does not  really fit her actions she is also said  to be in some ways a role model for the  later president corey elena snow the  hunger games the ballad of songbirds and  snakes is scheduled for release on  november 17th 2023 and is based on the  book of the same name by suzanne collins  who published the novel in may 2020  in 2020 ghost of tsushima one of sony's  best games for the past few years was  released on the playstation 4 primarily  the constant references to japanese  cinema and director akira kurosawa as  well as the breathtakingly beautiful  game world made the game created by  developer studio sucker punch  productions sell over 9 million units  within 2 years in its original form the  game in which you play the samurai jin  sakai is produced entirely in japanese  but of course it does feature  corresponding audio output and subtitles  the final movie is supposed to turn out  very similarly at least according to  director chad stahlski the john wick  director recently spoke in an interview  with collider about the way the upcoming  film will be made and it promises to be  extremely authentic due to his  connection to the japanese cult director  kurosawa among other reasons the ghost  of tsushima movie will be released in  japanese with appropriate subtitles  stahelski sees little issue with this  since western audiences are used to  reading subtitles anyway but that's not  all all the actors involved are also  expected to be from japan after all the  mongol invasion of the island of  tsushima which is the main subject of  the game was also a japanese affair sony  is said to be very much behind the idea  so it should only be a short period of  time before shooting starts there is no  exact release date for the movie yet  though given the early stage of  production we should not count on a  release in the next two years  actually the kung fu panda movie  franchise was as good as done after kung  fu panda 3 in 2016 however following the  recent success of the netflix series  kung fu panda the dragon knight those  responsible at dreamworks now seem to  believe that there is potential in a  fourth film and have made an official  announcement the film is expected to hit  theaters in march 2024 and will no  longer be distributed by 20th century  studios but by universal pictures also  joining the team is producer peter  hastings who was equally invested in  kung fu panda the dragon knight in the  original lead role we will again be able  to see or rather hear jack black is the  skilled martial artist panda poe however  the exact plot deals are not known as of  yet which also means that we don't know  whether the film will tie in with kung  fu panda the dragon knight or with kung  fu panda 3 in any way we are looking  forward to more information about kung  fu panda 4 which will be out in march  2024 and in the meantime we will keep  you posted  robert de niro's last appearance in his  starring role as a mobster was in 2019's  the irishman and now the 79 year old is  back at it again with his very next  project his new movie is called wiseguys  and it's based on the true story of  frank costello and vito genovese the two  mobsters are successful crime bosses who  compete against each other one day  genovese wants to kill frank costello  but the latter survives badly injured  and subsequently tries to turn his back  on the mob life the highlight is that  robert de niro will not only play frank  costello but also veto genovese at the  same time there's still no further news  about the cast or the plot but we do  know that the script will be written by  nicholas pallegi he already has some  experience as the author of the cult  films casino and goodfellas when it  comes to classic mob movies which should  certainly please genre fans goodfellas  producer irvin winkler is also coming  back meaning that de niro seems to value  the skills of those who already had  success with their projects back then  the only person missing to complete the  crew is martin scorsese's director one  might think however good morning vietnam  director barry levinson who at least has  experience working with robert de niro  will be directing the film precisely  when wise guys will be released has not  been determined so far  when the extremely inexpensive saw which  cost 1.2 million dollars to produce was  released almost 18 years ago no one  expected that a 10th part of the series  would one day be released we have known  more about it for a few months though  because saw 10 is indeed in the works  kevin grudert is to direct the film  which would be the third time he directs  a saw movie since he is one of the saw  greats behind the scenes not much is  known about the contents yet but the  return of jigsaw actor tobin bell is  considered certain after rumors have  been circulating for quite some time  already this also means the film will  not be a sequel but rather a prequel as  jigsaw already died in the third film  the last movie spiral from the book of  saw had two top class main actors with  comedian chris rock and samuel l jackson  but failed to win over the audience  overall became the financially weakest  film in the series in fact tobin bell  did not play a part in this film and  only appears in one photo which is the  reason why it is now hoped that his  return to the camera will bring about  the great revival of the movie series  the script was written by josh stolberg  and pete goldfinger both of whom have  been writing scripts for the saw  franchise for quite some time some  sources claim that saw 10 will take  place shortly before saw 3 and hence  just before jigsaw's death but this has  not been officially confirmed yet but at  least the official release date was  announced a few days ago and that is  planned for october 27 2023  and that was the news for this week if  you still haven't had enough take a look  at our big preview of the lord of the  rings the rings of power in our new  originals episode you can find out  everything there is to know about the  exciting amazon series coming up soon on  september 2nd 2022  [Music]

